@{ slug="cadillac"; name="Cadillac"; nameAr="كاديلاك"
   title="Cadillac Repair &amp; Service Dubai | FixHive Garage"
   desc="Expert Cadillac repair in Dubai. Escalade, CT5, XT5, XT6 &amp; CT4 specialists. V8 engine, Magnetic Ride Control &amp; Super Cruise servicing. FixHive Dubai."
   models="Escalade · CT5 · CT4 · XT5 · XT6 · Lyriq"
   heroSub="Dubai specialists for Cadillac Escalade, CT5, XT5 and XT6 — 6.2L V8, Magnetic Ride Control suspension, Super Cruise ADAS and Bose audio system care."
   intro1="Cadillac has a long-standing presence in Dubai and the broader GCC market, where the Escalade in particular holds an almost iconic status as the premium large SUV of choice for business and government fleets. The current generation Escalade, with its spectacular 38-inch curved OLED instrument cluster, 6.2-litre naturally aspirated V8 and air suspension, represents the absolute pinnacle of American luxury — and its service requirements match its sophistication."
   intro2="The 6.2-litre L87 V8 in the Escalade and CT5-V uses Active Fuel Management (AFM) cylinder deactivation, which can cause oil consumption and lifter noise issues if the dedicated AFM oil pressure isn't maintained. Cadillac specifies dexos1 Gen 3 full synthetic 0W-20 oil; substitution with other viscosities will cause the AFM system to behave incorrectly in Dubai's heat. The CT5 and CT4 use a 2.0-litre turbocharged four-cylinder — a robust engine but one that requires clean air filtration given Dubai's dusty environment."
   intro3="Magnetic Ride Control suspension, fitted to CT5-V and optionally to other models, uses magnetorheological fluid in the dampers and adjusts damper stiffness 1,000 times per second based on road input. In Dubai, where speed bumps are frequent and road surfaces can change abruptly, MRC dampers cycle more aggressively than in their designed climate. We service and replace Magnetic Ride Control units and carry out the associated calibration. FixHive also handles Super Cruise ADAS calibration following any windscreen work or front-end repair."
   i1h="L87 V8 Lifter Failures from AFM System"
   i1p="The Active Fuel Management system in the 6.2-litre V8 uses hydraulic lifters that collapse when cylinders deactivate. In Dubai's heat, if oil changes are delayed or incorrect oil viscosity is used, the AFM lifter passages can develop sludge that causes the lifters to stick in their collapsed position. This produces a distinctive ticking noise from the engine and a misfire condition. Left unaddressed, failed lifters can cause camshaft and pushrod damage. Prevention is straightforward: use Cadillac-specified dexos1 0W-20 and change oil every 8,000 km in Dubai rather than the Oil Life Monitor recommendation."
   i2h="Air Suspension Compressor Failures on Escalade"
   i2p="The Escalade's air suspension provides the supple, level ride expected of a luxury SUV, but the air compressor is a known weak point on high-mileage examples. Dubai's high ambient temperatures cause the compressor to cycle more frequently, and the intake air filter — which prevents dust from entering the system — degrades faster in the UAE's dusty environment. A failing compressor typically presents as a slow levelling-up after parking, a groaning sound from the rear when the car settles, and eventually a SERVICE RIDE CONTROL message. We carry Escalade air compressor units in stock."
   i3h="Magnetic Ride Control Damper Wear"
   i3p="Magnetic Ride Control dampers on CT5-V have a service life that is significantly shortened by UAE conditions. The frequency and severity of speed bumps on Dubai and Abu Dhabi roads — combined with the additional cycling caused by thermal expansion of the MR fluid — accelerates damper wear compared to the US market. Symptoms of worn MRC dampers include a loss of the characteristic comfortable-yet-controlled ride, increased body roll in corners and a harder-than-expected impact over sharp bumps. We use OEM Delphi MRC units for all replacements and perform the mandatory module adaptation after fitting."
   i4h="Infotainment OLED Screen Failures"
   i4p="The Escalade's 38-inch curved OLED display is a landmark piece of automotive technology, but OLED panels are more sensitive to prolonged heat exposure than conventional LCD screens. UAE-registered Escalades left in direct sunlight for extended periods during summer can experience premature pixel degradation, particularly in areas of the screen that display static content (like navigation icons). We recommend using the automatic sunshade and parking in shade wherever possible. We also perform the GM software update that reduces screen brightness when ambient temperature exceeds 45°C, which was introduced as a field fix for early OLED degradation."
   faq1q="How much does Cadillac Escalade servicing cost in Dubai?"
   faq1a="Annual Escalade services at FixHive covering oil and filter change, dexos1 top-up check, multi-point inspection and tyre rotation start from AED 600–900. Major services including air suspension inspection, brake fluid replacement and full drivetrain fluid service range from AED 1,200–2,000 depending on the model year."
   faq2q="What oil should I use in my Cadillac in Dubai?"
   faq2a="All Cadillac V8 models require dexos1 Gen 3 certified full synthetic 0W-20 oil. This specification is mandatory for correct AFM and VVT operation. Do not use 5W-30 or any other viscosity unless specifically instructed by a Cadillac-authorised diagnostic — the AFM system calibration depends on 0W-20 viscosity at operating temperature."
   faq3q="How often should I service my Cadillac in Dubai?"
   faq3a="We recommend oil changes every 8,000 km or annually in Dubai, rather than following the Oil Life Monitor alone. The UAE's heat cycles degrade oil faster than the OLM algorithm accounts for. Air filter replacement every 15,000 km is also advisable given Dubai's dust."
   faq4q="Can FixHive calibrate Super Cruise after a windscreen replacement?"
   faq4a="Yes. Super Cruise uses a forward-facing camera mounted at the top of the windscreen. After any windscreen replacement, the camera must be statically calibrated using manufacturer targets. We hold the GM ADAS calibration software and targets for all current Cadillac platforms."
   faq5q="What are common problems with the Cadillac Escalade in UAE?"
   faq5a="Air suspension compressor failures (especially on 2015-2020 models), AFM lifter noise on V8 engines and occasional OLED screen brightness issues are the most common items we see on UAE Escalades. All are preventable with correct servicing intervals and quality fluids."
   ctaSub="Escalade V8, Magnetic Ride Control and OLED infotainment care — American luxury serviced right in Dubai."
   waMsg="Hey%2C%20I%20saw%20your%20website%2C%20I%20wanted%20to%20book%20a%20Cadillac%20service"
   relatedEn='<a href="chevrolet-repair-dubai.html" style="padding:0.5rem 1.1rem;background:#f0f4ff;border:1.5px solid #c7d2fe;border-radius:20px;text-decoration:none;color:#1e3a8a;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;">Chevrolet</a><a href="gmc-repair-dubai.html" style="padding:0.5rem 1.1rem;background:#f0f4ff;border:1.5px solid #c7d2fe;border-radius:20px;text-decoration:none;color:#1e3a8a;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;">GMC</a><a href="ford-repair-dubai.html" style="padding:0.5rem 1.1rem;background:#f0f4ff;border:1.5px solid #c7d2fe;border-radius:20px;text-decoration:none;color:#1e3a8a;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;">Ford</a><a href="land-rover-repair-dubai.html" style="padding:0.5rem 1.1rem;background:#f0f4ff;border:1.5px solid #c7d2fe;border-radius:20px;text-decoration:none;color:#1e3a8a;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;">Land Rover</a><a href="mercedes-benz-repair-dubai.html" style="padding:0.5rem 1.1rem;background:#f0f4ff;border:1.5px solid #c7d2fe;border-radius:20px;text-decoration:none;color:#1e3a8a;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;">Mercedes-Benz</a>'
   titleAr="إصلاح كاديلاك في دبي | Escalade، CT5، XT5 | فيكس هايف"
   descAr="متخصصون في إصلاح وصيانة كاديلاك في دبي. Escalade وCT5 وXT5 وXT6. محرك V8 وتعليق Magnetic Ride Control. فيكس هايف دبي."
   heroSubAr="متخصصون في كاديلاك Escalade وCT5 وXT5 وXT6 — محرك V8، تعليق Magnetic Ride Control ونظام Super Cruise."
   intro1Ar="كاديلاك حضور راسخ في دبي ودول الخليج، حيث يحتفظ Escalade بمكانة أيقونية بوصفه السيارة الفاخرة الكبيرة المفضلة للأساطيل التجارية والحكومية. الجيل الحالي من Escalade بشاشة OLED المنحنية بعرض 38 بوصة ومحرك V8 6.2 لتر وتعليقه الهوائي يمثل قمة الفخامة الأمريكية."
   intro2Ar="محرك L87 V8 في Escalade وCT5-V يستخدم نظام AFM لإيقاف تشغيل أسطوانات. كاديلاك تحدد زيت dexos1 Gen 3 تخليقي كامل 0W-20؛ استخدام لزوجات أخرى يُعطّل نظام AFM في حرارة دبي."
   intro3Ar="تعليق Magnetic Ride Control المُثبَّت في CT5-V يستخدم سائلاً ريولوجياً مغناطيسياً يضبط صلابة المخمدات 1,000 مرة في الثانية. في دبي حيث المطبات متكررة وسطح الطريق يتغير فجأة، تعمل مخمدات MRC بشكل أكثر شدة مما يُسرّع التآكل."
   i1hAr="أعطال رافعات L87 V8 من نظام AFM"
   i1pAr="إذا تأخر تغيير الزيت أو استُخدم زيت بلزوجة خاطئة، يمكن أن تتراكم الترسبات في ممرات رافعات AFM وتتعطل. يُنتج هذا صوت طرق مميزاً من المحرك. الوقاية بسيطة: استخدام dexos1 0W-20 وتغيير الزيت كل 8,000 كم في دبي."
   i2hAr="أعطال ضاغط التعليق الهوائي في Escalade"
   i2pAr="يعاني ضاغط تعليق Escalade الهوائي من أعطال متكررة في الأمثلة عالية الكيلومترات. حرارة دبي المرتفعة تزيد من دورات الضاغط، كما يتدهور فلتر الهواء في بيئة الإمارات الغبارية بشكل أسرع."
   i3hAr="تآكل مخمدات Magnetic Ride Control"
   i3pAr="مطبات دبي المتكررة وتمدد سائل MR الحراري يُسرّعان تآكل المخمدات. الأعراض تشمل فقدان الراحة المميزة وزيادة التمايل في المنعطفات."
   i4hAr="أعطال شاشة OLED للمعلومات والترفيه"
   i4pAr="شاشة OLED المنحنية في Escalade أكثر حساسية للحرارة المطولة من شاشات LCD. نوصي باستخدام الستارة الشمسية والوقوف في الظل. نجري أيضاً تحديث البرنامج الذي يُخفّض سطوع الشاشة عند 45°C+."
   faq1qAr="كم تكلفة صيانة كاديلاك Escalade في دبي؟"
   faq1aAr="الصيانة السنوية من 600–900 درهم. الصيانة الشاملة من 1,200–2,000 درهم حسب الموديل."
   faq2qAr="ما الزيت الموصى به لكاديلاك في دبي؟"
   faq2aAr="جميع موديلات كاديلاك V8 تتطلب dexos1 Gen 3 تخليقي كامل 0W-20. لا تستبدل بـ 5W-30 أو أي لزوجة أخرى."
   faq3qAr="كم مرة يجب تغيير زيت كاديلاك في دبي؟"
   faq3aAr="نوصي بتغيير الزيت كل 8,000 كم سنوياً في دبي. حرارة الإمارات تُسرّع تدهور الزيت أسرع مما يحسبه مؤشر عمر الزيت."
   faq4qAr="هل تستطيع فيكس هايف معايرة Super Cruise بعد استبدال الزجاج الأمامي؟"
   faq4aAr="نعم. نمتلك برنامج معايرة ADAS من GM وأهداف المعايرة لجميع منصات كاديلاك الحالية."
   faq5qAr="ما أكثر أعطال كاديلاك Escalade شيوعاً في الإمارات؟"
   faq5aAr="أعطال ضاغط التعليق الهوائي وصوت رافعات V8 ومشكلات سطوع شاشة OLED من أكثر ما نراه في Escalade الإماراتية."
   ctaSubAr="رعاية V8 وMagnetic Ride Control وشاشة OLED — الفخامة الأمريكية تُصان بشكل صحيح في دبي."
},

@{ slug="changan"; name="Changan"; nameAr="شانجان"
   title="Changan Repair &amp; Service Dubai | FixHive Garage"
   desc="Expert Changan repair in Dubai. CS75 Plus, CS35 Plus, Uni-T, Uni-K, Lamore &amp; Alsvin specialists. Engine, gearbox &amp; ADAS servicing. FixHive Dubai."
   models="CS75 Plus · CS35 Plus · Uni-T · Uni-K · Lamore · Alsvin · Hunter"
   heroSub="Dubai specialists for Changan CS75, Uni-T, Uni-K and Lamore — turbocharged engine, DCT gearbox, ADAS calibration and all-climate servicing."
   intro1="Changan has emerged as one of the most competitive Chinese automotive brands in the UAE market, combining modern design, feature-rich specifications and competitive pricing that has attracted a significant owner base in Dubai and across the Emirates. The CS75 Plus and Uni-T are among the most frequently encountered Chinese SUVs on UAE roads, while the newer Uni-K and Lamore models have raised the brand's profile in the premium segment. As the Changan fleet grows, so does the demand for independent service specialists who understand the specific requirements of these vehicles."
   intro2="Changan's current generation uses turbocharged four-cylinder petrol engines — principally the 1.5T and 2.0T TGDI units — paired with either conventional torque converter automatics or Dual Clutch Transmissions (DCT). The 2.0T engine is a competitive unit but requires strict adherence to oil specifications in UAE conditions; Changan recommends 5W-30 full synthetic and the engine is sensitive to oil quality in high ambient temperatures. The DCT gearbox, fitted to many CS75 and Uni-series models, requires its own specific transmission fluid that must be replaced every 60,000 km to prevent the clutch pack wear that is DCTs' Achilles heel in stop-start urban traffic."
   intro3="Changan's ADAS suite on current models is notably comprehensive for the price point, including forward collision warning, automatic emergency braking, blind spot monitoring and a 360-degree camera system. All these systems require periodic calibration, particularly after any windscreen work or front-end repair. FixHive provides the full range of Changan mechanical and electronic service, with diagnostic tools that cover the complete fault code range and adaptation functions for Changan's engine management and gearbox control systems."
   i1h="DCT Gearbox Judder in Dubai Stop-Start Traffic"
   i1p="Changan's Dual Clutch Transmission is well-suited to motorway driving but faces its most demanding conditions in Dubai's stop-start urban traffic, where the wet clutch packs engage and disengage at very low speeds hundreds of times per hour. In temperatures above 40°C, the clutch fluid in the DCT sump degrades faster, increasing clutch-to-clutch friction and causing a judder or hesitation when pulling away from standstill. The DCT fluid must be replaced every 60,000 km; in heavy city driving we recommend every 40,000 km. We also carry out the DCT clutch adaptation procedure after fluid replacement to reset the clutch engagement point."
   i2h="2.0T TGDI Engine Overheating Under Sustained Load"
   i2p="The 2.0-litre TGDI turbocharged engine in higher-specification CS75 Plus and Uni-K models produces strong performance but generates significant heat under sustained high-load conditions. In UAE summers, driving at highway speeds with full AC load can push coolant temperature to the upper limit of the normal range. The engine's low-pressure EGR system — used for emission compliance — can accumulate carbon deposits in the intake manifold over time, reducing airflow efficiency and contributing to temperature increases. We perform intake manifold cleaning and EGR system inspection at every major service."
   i3h="Air Conditioning Compressor Failures"
   i3p="Changan's Chinese-sourced air conditioning compressors are adequate for temperate climates but work at the edge of their design envelope in Dubai's 8-month summer. The compressor clutch and magnetic coil are the most frequent failure items — the clutch slips initially under the extreme load of maximum compressor operation, producing a squealing noise when AC is first switched on. Left unaddressed, a slipping clutch burns the magnetic coil and eventually seizes the compressor. We carry Changan-compatible aftermarket compressors and can complete the compressor replacement including system evacuation and recharge in a single day."
   i4h="ADAS Camera &amp; Sensor Calibration"
   i4p="Changan's Advanced Driver Assistance Systems on current models use a windscreen-mounted forward camera for lane departure and collision detection, plus ultrasonic sensors and a rear camera for the parking system. After any windscreen replacement or front-end panel repair, the forward camera requires static calibration at a specific distance from calibration targets. The rear parking sensors require gap verification after any rear bumper work. FixHive has invested in the Changan-compatible calibration equipment and software to complete all ADAS procedures correctly."
   faq1q="How much does Changan servicing cost in Dubai?"
   faq1a="Minor Changan services at FixHive start from AED 300–450, covering oil and filter change, multi-point inspection and fluid top-ups. Major services every 30,000 km including DCT fluid, air filter, spark plugs and brake inspection range from AED 600–900."
   faq2q="How often should I change DCT fluid on a Changan?"
   faq2a="Every 40,000–60,000 km in Dubai conditions. DCT gearboxes are more sensitive to fluid condition than conventional automatics, and Dubai's heat and stop-start traffic accelerate fluid degradation. Never use universal ATF in a Changan DCT — always use the specified Changan DCT fluid."
   faq3q="Is the Changan 2.0T engine reliable in Dubai heat?"
   faq3a="Yes, with correct servicing. The 2.0T TGDI engine is a well-engineered unit, but it requires quality 5W-30 full synthetic oil changed every 7,500–10,000 km in UAE conditions, and the air filter must be inspected more frequently than in cooler climates due to Dubai's dust. The intake manifold benefits from a carbon cleaning service every 60,000 km."
   faq4q="Does FixHive have diagnostic tools for Changan?"
   faq4a="Yes. We use diagnostic software covering all current Changan models sold in the UAE, including full fault code access, live data streams and adaptation functions for the engine management, DCT gearbox, ABS and ADAS systems."
   faq5q="What is the recommended service interval for Changan in the UAE?"
   faq5a="We recommend oil changes every 7,500–10,000 km, air filter inspection every 15,000 km, and a full major service every 30,000 km covering spark plugs, DCT fluid (if applicable), brake fluid and a comprehensive brake and suspension inspection."
   ctaSub="Changan 1.5T and 2.0T engine care, DCT servicing and ADAS calibration — quality independent service in Dubai."
   waMsg="Hey%2C%20I%20saw%20your%20website%2C%20I%20wanted%20to%20book%20a%20Changan%20service"
   relatedEn='<a href="chery-repair-dubai.html" style="padding:0.5rem 1.1rem;background:#f0f4ff;border:1.5px solid #c7d2fe;border-radius:20px;text-decoration:none;color:#1e3a8a;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;">Chery</a><a href="haval-repair-dubai.html" style="padding:0.5rem 1.1rem;background:#f0f4ff;border:1.5px solid #c7d2fe;border-radius:20px;text-decoration:none;color:#1e3a8a;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;">Haval</a><a href="mg-repair-dubai.html" style="padding:0.5rem 1.1rem;background:#f0f4ff;border:1.5px solid #c7d2fe;border-radius:20px;text-decoration:none;color:#1e3a8a;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;">MG</a><a href="geely-repair-dubai.html" style="padding:0.5rem 1.1rem;background:#f0f4ff;border:1.5px solid #c7d2fe;border-radius:20px;text-decoration:none;color:#1e3a8a;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;">Geely</a><a href="toyota-repair-dubai.html" style="padding:0.5rem 1.1rem;background:#f0f4ff;border:1.5px solid #c7d2fe;border-radius:20px;text-decoration:none;color:#1e3a8a;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;">Toyota</a>'
   titleAr="إصلاح شانجان في دبي | CS75، Uni-T، Uni-K | فيكس هايف"
   descAr="متخصصون في إصلاح وصيانة شانجان في دبي. CS75 Plus وCS35 وUni-T وUni-K ولامور. محرك توربو وناقل DCT ومعايرة ADAS."
   heroSubAr="متخصصون في شانجان CS75 وUni-T وUni-K ولامور — محرك توربو وناقل DCT ومعايرة ADAS في جميع الظروف المناخية."
   intro1Ar="برزت شانجان بوصفها من أكثر العلامات الصينية تنافسية في السوق الإماراتية، إذ جمعت تصميماً عصرياً ومواصفات غنية وأسعاراً تنافسية استقطبت قاعدة عملاء واسعة في دبي وسائر الإمارات. CS75 Plus وUni-T من أكثر SUVs الصينية انتشاراً في الإمارات."
   intro2Ar="تستخدم شانجان الحالية محركات توربو 1.5T و2.0T TGDI مقترنة بناقلات تلقائية تقليدية أو ناقلات DCT ذات قابض مزدوج. محرك 2.0T وحدة تنافسية لكنها حساسة لجودة الزيت في الحرارة الشديدة. ناقل DCT في كثير من موديلات CS75 وUni يحتاج سائله الخاص كل 60,000 كم."
   intro3Ar="مجموعة ADAS في شانجان الحالية شاملة بشكل لافت للفئة السعرية. جميع هذه الأنظمة تحتاج معايرة دورية خاصة بعد أعمال الزجاج أو تصليح المقدمة. فيكس هايف تقدم خدمة ميكانيكية وإلكترونية كاملة لشانجان."
   i1hAr="اهتزاز ناقل DCT في ازدحام دبي"
   i1pAr="ناقل DCT في شانجان يواجه تحدياته الأصعب في ازدحام دبي حيث تنخرط صفائح القابض وتنفصل بسرعات منخفضة جداً مئات المرات في الساعة. سائل القابض يتدهور بشكل أسرع فوق 40°C. يجب تغيير سائل DCT كل 40,000–60,000 كم."
   i2hAr="ارتفاع حرارة محرك 2.0T في ظروف الحمل المستمر"
   i2pAr="يولّد محرك 2.0T TGDI حرارة كبيرة في ظروف الحمل المرتفع. في صيف الإمارات قد ترتفع درجة حرارة سائل التبريد إلى الحد الأعلى. رواسب الكربون في مشعب السحب تُقلّل كفاءة تدفق الهواء."
   i3hAr="أعطال ضاغط التكييف"
   i3pAr="ضواغط التكييف الصينية في شانجان تعمل عند حافة نطاق تصميمها في صيف دبي الممتد 8 أشهر. القابض والملف المغناطيسي أكثر قطع الأعطال شيوعاً."
   i4hAr="معايرة كاميرا ADAS والحساسات"
   i4pAr="تستخدم أنظمة ADAS في شانجان الحالية كاميرا أمامية مثبتة على الزجاج وحساسات فوق صوتية. بعد أي استبدال للزجاج يجب معايرة الكاميرا."
   faq1qAr="كم تكلفة صيانة شانجان في دبي؟"
   faq1aAr="تبدأ الصيانة الخفيفة من 300–450 درهم. الصيانة الشاملة كل 30,000 كم من 600–900 درهم."
   faq2qAr="كم مرة يجب تغيير سائل DCT في شانجان؟"
   faq2aAr="كل 40,000–60,000 كم في ظروف دبي. لا تستخدم سائل ATF عاماً في ناقل شانجان DCT — استخدم السائل المحدد دائماً."
   faq3qAr="هل محرك شانجان 2.0T موثوق في حرارة دبي؟"
   faq3aAr="نعم مع الصيانة الصحيحة. يتطلب زيت تخليقي 5W-30 كامل كل 7,500–10,000 كم وتنظيف مشعب السحب من الكربون كل 60,000 كم."
   faq4qAr="هل تمتلك فيكس هايف أدوات تشخيص لشانجان؟"
   faq4aAr="نعم. نستخدم برامج تشخيص تغطي جميع موديلات شانجان الحالية في الإمارات."
   faq5qAr="ما الفترة الموصى بها لصيانة شانجان في الإمارات؟"
   faq5aAr="تغيير الزيت كل 7,500–10,000 كم وفحص فلتر الهواء كل 15,000 كم وصيانة شاملة كل 30,000 كم."
   ctaSubAr="رعاية محرك 1.5T و2.0T وناقل DCT ومعايرة ADAS — خدمة مستقلة متخصصة في دبي."
},

@{ slug="chery"; name="Chery"; nameAr="شيري"
   title="Chery Repair &amp; Service Dubai | FixHive Garage"
   desc="Expert Chery repair in Dubai. Tiggo 8 Pro, Tiggo 7 Pro, Arrizo 6 Pro &amp; Tiggo 4 specialists. Turbo engine, CVT &amp; DCT servicing. FixHive Garage Dubai."
   models="Tiggo 8 Pro · Tiggo 7 Pro · Tiggo 4 Pro · Arrizo 6 Pro · Omoda 5"
   heroSub="Dubai specialists for Chery Tiggo 8, Tiggo 7, Arrizo 6 and Omoda 5 — turbocharged engine servicing, CVT and DCT gearbox care, ADAS and AC maintenance."
   intro1="Chery has established a meaningful foothold in the UAE automotive market, particularly with the Tiggo 8 Pro — a seven-seat SUV that offers premium European-influenced styling and a long feature list at a price point significantly below European and Japanese competitors. The Omoda 5 has more recently generated strong interest from younger buyers seeking a stylish crossover with modern technology at an accessible price. As Chery's UAE fleet grows, the need for skilled independent service — beyond the limited dealer network — has increased."
   intro2="Chery's current UAE lineup uses a 1.6T turbocharged petrol engine (the SQRE4T16D) in most Tiggo and Arrizo models, producing 145–197 horsepower depending on tune. This engine pairs with either a CVT (continuous variable transmission) or a 7DCT dual-clutch gearbox. The CVT variant offers smooth urban driving but requires Chery-specified CVT fluid replacement every 60,000 km — a service that is often overlooked. The 7DCT is quicker-responding but requires wet clutch pack fluid at the same interval and a clutch adaptation reset after fluid changes."
   intro3="Chery's ADAS systems on Pro models are comprehensive and well-integrated, but they require periodic alignment checks and camera calibration. The 360-degree camera system is particularly useful in Dubai's tight parking environments but requires calibration after any bumper repair or camera unit replacement. FixHive provides the complete range of Chery service, with technicians trained on all current Chery platforms and diagnostic tools that give full access to Chery's proprietary fault code architecture."
   i1h="CVT Transmission Overheating in Dubai Traffic"
   i1p="Chery's CVT-equipped Tiggo 8 and Arrizo 6 models use a belt-driven continuously variable transmission that is particularly sensitive to fluid condition in Dubai's climate. The prolonged stop-start driving that characterises Dubai city traffic keeps the CVT under near-continuous load at low belt-to-pulley speed ratios — the most thermally demanding operating condition for this type of gearbox. CVT fluid at incorrect level or beyond service life causes belt slippage, pulley wear and in extreme cases complete CVT failure. We recommend Chery CVT fluid changes every 40,000 km in UAE conditions rather than the factory 60,000 km specification."
   i2h="1.6T Engine Carbon Buildup on Intake Valves"
   i2p="Direct-injection turbocharged engines like Chery's 1.6T TGDI are prone to carbon buildup on the backs of the intake valves because fuel is injected directly into the combustion chamber rather than washing the valves as in port-injected engines. In Dubai's dusty environment this process is accelerated by air filter degradation, which allows fine particles to enter the intake path and adhere to the carbon deposits. Symptoms include rough idle, hesitation on acceleration and a minor power reduction. We offer a walnut blasting intake valve cleaning service that removes these deposits without engine disassembly."
   i3h="Air Conditioning Evaporator &amp; Compressor Issues"
   i3p="Dubai's climate demands maximum AC output for 8 months of the year, which places the Chery AC system under sustained stress. The evaporator — mounted inside the dashboard in a relatively tight space — is susceptible to mould growth in the humid UAE coastal environment when the car is parked for extended periods without the AC running the dry-out cycle. We perform an evaporator sterilisation service using ozone treatment and carry out a full refrigerant pressure test at every major service. The AC compressor belt tension is also checked at every service — a loose belt causes compressor clutch slippage and premature wear."
   i4h="Suspension &amp; Steering Wear on UAE Roads"
   i4p="UAE road surfaces, while generally well-maintained, include a significant number of speed bumps and occasional sections of rough highway surface. Chery's Tiggo 8 and Tiggo 7, despite their relatively large wheel/tyre fitments, have front lower control arm bushings and front sway bar links that wear faster in UAE conditions than in temperate markets. Symptoms include a clunking noise over speed bumps, increased steering wander and tyre wear that is uneven across the tread width. We carry Chery-compatible suspension components in stock and align all four wheels after any suspension component replacement."
   faq1q="How much does Chery servicing cost in Dubai?"
   faq1a="Minor Chery services at FixHive start from AED 280–400, covering oil and filter change, multi-point safety check and fluid level top-ups. Major services every 30,000 km including CVT or DCT fluid, air filter, spark plugs and brake inspection range from AED 550–850."
   faq2q="How often should I change CVT fluid on a Chery Tiggo in Dubai?"
   faq2a="Every 40,000 km in Dubai conditions. The factory 60,000 km recommendation is for temperate climates. Dubai's heat and stop-start traffic degrade CVT fluid faster and the consequences of fluid failure are costly — CVT replacement can exceed AED 8,000."
   faq3q="Is the Chery 1.6T engine reliable in the UAE?"
   faq3a="Generally yes, with proper maintenance. The key requirements are quality 5W-30 full synthetic oil changed every 7,500 km, clean air filtration (change filters every 15,000 km in Dubai dust), and an intake valve carbon clean every 60,000 km for direct-injection variants."
   faq4q="Does FixHive service the Chery Omoda 5?"
   faq4a="Yes. The Omoda 5 is a relatively new model but we have full diagnostic coverage. Its 1.6T engine and DCT gearbox are variants of systems used across the Tiggo lineup, so our technicians are fully familiar with the platform."
   faq5q="What are common problems with Chery vehicles in Dubai?"
   faq5a="CVT fluid degradation leading to shudder or overheating, intake valve carbon buildup on the 1.6T, AC compressor wear and front suspension bushing wear are the most frequent issues we see on UAE Chery vehicles. All are manageable with correct servicing."
   ctaSub="Chery 1.6T engine care, CVT and DCT servicing, ADAS calibration — expert independent service in Dubai."
